    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order imposein respect of the list of commodities specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy at the ratesspecified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
